cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Blood-flow solver"
abstract: >-
  This repository contains a C++/deal.II implementation of a one-dimensional
  blood-flow model on vessel networks embedded in three-dimensional space. The
  application currently assembles an HDG-type (hybridized) monolithic system:
  cell area/velocity unknowns, face trace unknowns, and (for RCR terminals)
  capacitor-pressure unknowns are held in one distributed vector. SUNDIALS IDA
  advances the resulting differential-algebraic system.
repository-code: "https://github.com/devi-raksha/blood-flow"

